# Deployment

Known layout: VPS project `/opt/company-chat`. Production API `https://api.michat.in`, web `https://web.michat.in`, TURN `turn.michat.in`. S3 bucket `michat-main-bucket` in `ap-south-1`.

A push to `main` may trigger automatic production CD. Do not push to `main` or trigger workflows while merely preparing a PR.

Preserve Docker exact-image-ID rollback. Preserve database and service isolation. Do not modify unrelated VPS services or overwrite production environment files.

Do not print secrets. Do not run migrations unless needed and explicitly authorized. Keep deployment diffs minimal.
